| 8 | **Observability (Logs/Traces)** | 100% telemetry to SIEM with full context | Send 1000 events, verify SIEM ingestion | Ingestion rate |
| 9 | **Deployment** | Deploy successfully in dev/test/prod | Deploy 3 isolated environments | All 3 environments working |
| 10 | **AgentRuntime (Isolation)** | Multi-tenant agent separation | Create 2 tenants, verify data isolation | 100% isolated |

