## DETAILED VALIDATION BY AREA

### 1. AGENT/TOOL/SHADOW DISCOVERY & DETECTION

**Purpose**: Verify comprehensive visibility into all AI usage

| Test | What to Deploy | Expected Result | Pass/Fail |
|------|----------------|-----------------|-----------|
| **Agent Discovery** | 5 agents: Custom OpenAI agent, LangChain agent, AutoGPT, commercial agent, shadow autonomous agent | All 5 detected in dashboard within 24h | □ |
| **Tool Discovery** | Agent with 10 tools: web search, database, file system, API, email, Slack, calculator, browser automation, SSH, custom tool | All 10 tools mapped with permissions | □ |
| **Shadow AI Detection** | 3 shadow tools: Personal ChatGPT account, Claude.ai, unauthorized browser extension | All 3 detected as unauthorized | □ |
| **Context Capture** | Execute 20 agent tasks across different users | Full context logged: user, prompt, tools used, data accessed | □ |
| **Risk Scoring** | Review 10 discovered assets | Each has risk score (high/medium/low) with justification | □ |

**Critical**: Agent + Tool + Shadow detection (3 tests)  
**Important**: Context + Risk scoring (2 tests)

