## TEST DATA REQUIREMENTS

### For Discovery
- **5 Agents**: Custom OpenAI agent, LangChain agent, AutoGPT, commercial AI agent, shadow autonomous agent
- **10 Tools**: Web search, PostgreSQL database, file system, REST API, email (SMTP), Slack API, calculator, browser automation, SSH, custom webhook
- **3 Shadow AI**: Personal ChatGPT Plus account, Claude.ai personal account, unauthorized browser extension

### For Interception
- **Browsers**: Chrome, Edge, Firefox (latest versions)
- **Proxy**: ZScaler, Netskope, or Palo Alto Prisma Access
- **Certificate**: SSL/TLS inspection certificate

### For Guardrails
- **100 Adversarial Prompts**:
  - 30 prompt injection variants
  - 30 jailbreak attempts
  - 20 toxic content prompts
  - 20 malicious code requests

### For DLP
- **50 PII Prompts**:
  - 10 with SSN
  - 10 with credit cards
  - 10 with emails
  - 10 with phone numbers
  - 10 with PHI (medical data)

